This package is a themed edition of Hydra (`packages/private-games/hydra`), itself an adaptation
of a board game released under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
International licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/). It is shared under the
same licence, unlike the rest of this repository.

It holds no names, wording, art or fonts of its own: all of them come from private storage at run
time, along with the full credits for the original game and for the edition's art, which are
shown in the game itself to the players it is shared with.
